-- Topics from the database (src/db/topics.ts): every table says which question family its change belongs to, as the
-- row feed's triggers say which rows changed (0106). topic_changed(topic, project id) is a JS function
-- (registerMigrationFunctions, db/index.ts). These statements are topicTriggerSql() as it was when this was written;
-- topics.test.ts checks a migrated database against TABLE_TOPICS, so a change there needs a migration that drops and
-- makes the triggers again, as does one that rebuilds a table.
